# CVEs with no available fix in Debian Bookworm as of 2026-06-13.
# Reviewed: apt-get upgrade is run at build time so any released patch is applied.
# Re-evaluate each entry when status changes from affected/fix_deferred/will_not_fix.

# zlib1g: integer overflow in zipOpenNewFileInZip4_6 — Debian marked will_not_fix
# Impact: only reachable via crafted ZIP files; agentbox does not process user-supplied ZIPs
CVE-2023-45853

# libsqlite3-0: integer overflow — no Debian fix available (status: affected)
# Impact: only reachable via crafted DB files; agentbox uses SQLite only in tests (SQLAlchemy)
CVE-2025-7458

# ncurses: buffer overflow — no Debian fix available (status: affected)
# These packages are purged in the Dockerfile; entry kept as belt-and-braces
CVE-2025-69720

# perl-base: multiple CVEs — fix_deferred or affected (no released Debian patch)
# perl-base is purged in the Dockerfile; entries kept as belt-and-braces
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-42497
CVE-2026-48959
CVE-2026-48962
CVE-2026-8376
CVE-2026-9538
